      "id": "VerityLakefront_Text_LakeVerityAhead",
      "en_US": [
        "Lake Verity Ahead\r",
        "According to legend, this lake is home\n",
        "to the Pokémon said to be “The Being of\f",
        "Emotion.”\r",
        "It is because of this Pokémon that\n",
        "people can experience sorrow and joy."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Lac Vérité droit devant\r",
        "D’après la légende, ce lac abrite un\n",
        "Pokémon appelé “être de l’émotion”.\r",
        "C’est grâce à lui que les humains\n",
        "peuvent ressentir la joie et la peine."
      ]
